{
  "_doc": "Every action the player can press, grouped by context. Read by Controls (conflict rules, the Controls tab, rebinding) and tools/controls_doc.py (docs/controls.md). Bindings themselves live in project.godot; 'pad'/'key' here only override the generated text for stick groups and notes. 'reserved' rows are bound but not used yet, so they are hidden from players.",
